617
00:39:36,320 --> 00:39:37,760
Grand-mère est venue nous accueillir aussi !

618
00:39:38,640 --> 00:39:39,760
Vite, Zhengyou !

619
00:39:41,240 --> 00:39:42,480
Arrière-grand-mère !

620
00:39:42,640 --> 00:39:44,080
Arrière-grand-mère !

621
00:39:45,400 --> 00:39:46,040
Maman !

622
00:39:46,080 --> 00:39:47,600
Arrière-grand-mère !

623
00:39:47,800 --> 00:39:49,280
Le bateau de Zhen arrive !

624
00:39:55,400 --> 00:39:56,320
Zhengyou,

625
00:39:58,840 --> 00:40:00,200
