655
00:42:08,400 --> 00:42:10,320
Maman, vous pouvez y aller seule ?

656
00:42:10,880 --> 00:42:11,840
Oui.

657
00:42:19,120 --> 00:42:19,920
Seigneur Huit,

658
00:42:20,280 --> 00:42:23,240
